          "role": "user",
          "content": "A freight forwarder advances shipping-line, airline, customs, and port charges to clients. When are these amounts reimbursements, pass-through advances, VATable sales, zero-rated services, or ordinary gross receipts?",
          "created_at": "2026-07-15T00:57:24.695391+00:00",
          "sources_used": null,
          "fallback_references": null,
          "metadata": {
            "adaptive": {
